    "severity": "warning",
    "message": "8 modification(s) could not be mapped to a UNIMOD accession or a mass, and are carried in ProForma as [Info:...] tags: UniProt:(3S)-3-hydroxyasparagine on N, UniProt:(3S)-3-hydroxyaspartate on D, UniProt:3'-nitrotyrosine on Y, UniProt:N6-crotonyllysine on K, UniProt:N6-malonyllysine on K, UniProt:N6-succinyllysine on K, UniProt:O-palmitoleoyl serine on S, UniProt:Omega-hydroxyceramide glutamate ester on Q. Their ptm_sites rows exist and carry modification_name, with modification null, so a query by name finds them and a query by UNIMOD accession will not."
   },
